{"product_id":"the-subtle-knife-adult-edition-his-dark-materials","title":"The Subtle Knife: Adult Edition (His Dark Materials)","description":"\u003cp\u003eLyra finds herself in a shimmering, haunted underworld-Cittagazze, where soul-eating Specters stalk the streets and wingbeats of distant angels sound against the sky. But she is not without allies: 12-year-old Will Parry, fleeing for his life after taking another's, has also stumbled into this strange new realm. On a perilous journey from world to world, Lyra and Will discover an object of devastating power. And with every step, they move closer to an even greater threat-and the shattering truth of their own destiny.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Philip Pullman\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780439994132\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Trade Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 122 x 196\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595489710233,"sku":"10RD9780439994132","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-subtle-knife-adult-edition-his-dark-materials-796964.jpg?v=1694792469","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-subtle-knife-adult-edition-his-dark-materials","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}